msgstr "可以在以下情况后停用："

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:613
msgid "Theme License - "
msgstr "主题许可 -"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:866
msgid ""
"Unexpected Error! The query to retrieve the license data returned a "
"malformed response."
msgstr "意外错误！检索许可证数据的查询返回了格式错误的响应。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:886
msgid "The license is already in use for this domain."
msgstr "该许可证已用于该域。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:891
msgid ""
"The license has reached the maximum number of activations and cannot be "
"activated for this domain."
msgstr "许可证已达到最大激活次数，无法为此域激活。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:896
msgid "The license is already inactive for this domain."
msgstr "该域的许可证已处于非活动状态。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:900
msgid "The license may not be deactivated yet."
msgstr "该许可证可能尚未停用。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:907
msgid ""
"The license is blocked and cannot be updated anymore. Please use another "
"license key."
msgstr "许可证已被锁定，无法再更新。请使用另一个许可证密钥。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:910
msgid ""
"The license has not been activated and its status is still pending. Please "
"try again or use another license key."
msgstr "许可证尚未激活，其状态仍处于待定状态。请重试或使用其他许可证密钥。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:913
msgid "The provided license key is invalid. Please use another license key."
msgstr "提供的许可证密钥无效。请使用另一个许可证密钥。"

#. translators: the license expiry date
#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:923
#, php-format
msgid "The license expired on %s and needs to be renewed to be updated."
msgstr "%s的License已过期，需要续订才能更新。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:927
msgid "The license expired and needs to be renewed to be updated."
msgstr "许可证已过期，需要续订才能更新。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:934
msgid ""
"The provided license key does not appear to be valid. Please use another "
"license key."
msgstr "提供的许可证密钥似乎无效。请使用另一个许可证密钥。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:939
msgid ""
"An active license is required to update the plugin. Please provide a valid "
"license key in Plugins > Installed Plugins."
msgstr "更新插件需要有效许可证。请在插件 > 已安装的插件中​​提供有效的许可证密钥。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:941
msgid ""
"An active license is required to update the theme. Please provide a valid "
"license key in Appearence > Theme License."
msgstr "更新主题需要有效许可证。请在外观 > 主题许可证中提供有效的许可证密钥。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:946
msgid "An unexpected error has occured."
msgstr "发生意外错误。"

#: lib/updatepulse-updater/class-updatepulse-updater.php:952
msgid ""
"An unexpected error has occured. Please try again. If the problem persists, "
"please contact support."
msgstr "发生意外错误。请再试一次。如果问题仍然存在，请联系支持人员。"

